  ▲ Missing format arguments
   ╭─[test.lis:5:3]
 4 │ fn main() {
 5 │   log.Printf("%d %d", 1)
   ·   ───────────┬──────────
   ·              ╰── 2 verbs, 1 argument
 6 │ }
   ╰────
  help: Add the missing argument, remove the verb, or write `%%` for a literal percent sign. `log.Printf` has 2 verbs but 1 argument, so `%d` prints as `%!d(MISSING)` · code: [lint.printf_verb_mismatch]
